      "seed": 55722,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 435545,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Prompt caching     — stable prefix. Aksar 50–90% input cost bachata hai.\n2. Model routing      — easy queries chhote model pe. 10–20× sasta.\n3. Output tokens kam  — output input se 3–5× mehnga hota hai.\n4. Semantic cache     — repeated questions pe LLM call hi mat karo.\n5. Parallel tool calls — latency, cost nahi, par UX pe bada asar.\n6. Streaming          — perceived latency. Real fix nahi, par sasta hai.\n7. Context trim       — har token do baar lagta hai: cost + KV memory.",
      "originalText": "1. Prompt caching     — stable prefix. Aksar 50–90% input cost bachata hai.\n2. Model routing      — easy queries chhote model pe. 10–20× sasta.\n3. Output tokens kam  — output input se 3–5× mehnga hota hai.\n4. Semantic cache     — repeated questions pe LLM call hi mat karo.\n5. Parallel tool calls — latency, cost nahi, par UX pe bada asar.\n6. Streaming          — perceived latency. Real fix nahi, par sasta hai.\n7. Context trim       — har token do baar lagta hai: cost + KV memory.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
