      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "☐ Timeouts + retries har external call pe (LLM bhi external hai)\n☐ Fallback model configured aur TESTED\n☐ Cost per request measured, aur alert lagaya\n☐ Har request ka trace, aur run_id user ko dikhta hai (support ke liye)\n☐ Prompt version-controlled, deploy se decoupled\n☐ Eval suite CI mein, regression pe merge block\n☐ Kill switch — ek flag se feature band ho jaaye\n☐ Rate limit per user, warna ek user poora budget kha jaayega",
      "originalText": "☐ Timeouts + retries har external call pe (LLM bhi external hai)\n☐ Fallback model configured aur TESTED\n☐ Cost per request measured, aur alert lagaya\n☐ Har request ka trace, aur run_id user ko dikhta hai (support ke liye)\n☐ Prompt version-controlled, deploy se decoupled\n☐ Eval suite CI mein, regression pe merge block\n☐ Kill switch — ek flag se feature band ho jaaye\n☐ Rate limit per user, warna ek user poora budget kha jaayega",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
